    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/ontologies/kg.owl#ChemicalConcept"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Chemical Lists defined by the US EPA and used in the EPA's Comptox Dashboard web application. These lists are scraped from the Dashboard's public-facing API.

A chemical list is loosely defined, but they can be thought of in broad terms as functional classes of chemicals. They range in size from a few chemicals to tens of thousands of chemicals.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
